      "en": "A **regex** (**regular expression**) = a pattern describing text. A **character class** `[0-9]` or `\\d` (a digit), `\\w` (letter/digit/_), `\\s` (space), `.` (any character). A **quantifier** says how many: `+` (1 or more), `*` (0 or more), `?` (optional), `{3}` and `{2,4}`. And `^` and `$` = the start and end of the text."
