      "en": "The **global flag** `g`: every match, not only the first. `i`: case-insensitive. `m`: `^` and `$` per line. The **unicode flag** `u`: understands whole characters (emoji, `\\p{…}`) — always use it with Arabic. And **matchall** returns every match with its details."
