      "en": "Plain `sort()` orders by character codes — wrong for Arabic and names. **intl.collator** sorts by the language’s rules. And **intl.segmenter** splits text into words or sentences properly (better than split(\" \") with punctuation) — handy for word counts and to **tokenize**."
